  "summary": "Most companies are stuck dealing with expensive, manual workflows like approvals, compliance checks, audits, and outbound pipelines that haven't changed in twenty years. I build custom AI systems that automate these processes precisely, reliably, and without messing up your existing operations.\nMy work spans three main areas.\nFirst, AI Automation & Document Intelligence. I build systems that parse structured documents, extract data using LLMs, and automate compliance and audit workflows.\nSecond, Full-Stack Web & SaaS Architecture. I build production-ready platforms from design to deployment using tools like Next.js, FastAPI, and Cloudflare.\nThird, Autonomous Pipeline Engineering. I design closed-loop data systems that run without human intervention, like outbound orchestration, monitoring, and AI-triggered workflows.\nI've shipped real software for real organizations. Some examples include a public-facing platform for a nonprofit consulting firm, a B2B SaaS with live billing and autonomous email outreach, and AI-powered analytics tools with cloud video pipelines.\nIf your company has a painful, repetitive workflow that costs you time or exposes you to risk, send me a message. I'll give you an honest answer on whether or not AI can fix it.",
