    "description": "I build and deploy custom AI automation systems for B2B operations. My main focus is on document intelligence, autonomous pipeline architecture, and delivering full-stack SaaS products.\n\nHere are a few projects I've shipped:\n\nVaultReach Platform (Live, Production): A complete B2B SaaS platform that includes user authentication, Stripe billing, and an autonomous outbound email system. It handles everything from pulling leads in Apollo to generating AI copy and monitoring the inbox.\n\nAI Prediction Market Analytics Engine (Live, Production): An autonomous media pipeline that ingests real-time data, analyzes it using multiple AI providers like Gemini and OpenAI, and automatically generates and distributes videos to the cloud.\n\nCOI Compliance Prototype (Functional Prototype): An AI engine I designed to read ACORD 25 insurance certificates. It automatically flags any vendor coverage deficiencies based on custom policy minimums.\n\nCore tech stack: Python, FastAPI, Next.js, React, Claude & OpenAI APIs, Cloudflare, Railway, and PostgreSQL.",
